# phase5 verification — raw literal log

Scope: P4 rail, P5 chips, P7 report wiring, P12 exam-mode history filter, M8
strike toggle, P15 activation hint, P16 profile rank. P19 + theme toggle are
diagnostic-only (observed, not built) and recorded in section 0.
No prose verdicts below — command + literal output only.

Code footprint:
  src/routes/sessions.routes.ts         (+chip fields on session payload,
                                         +?mode= on GET /api/sessions)
  web/src/lib/types.ts                  (+SessionQuestionEntry chip fields)
  web/src/components/AnswerOption.tsx   (+strike control + struck visuals)
  web/src/components/QuestionCard.tsx   (+struck state, +chip row, P5 props)
  web/src/app/sessions/[id]/page.tsx    (+P4 rail, +P7 modal/wiring, +chips,
                                         +AnswerState fields incl. Phase 2 fix)
  web/src/app/historique/page.tsx       (+mode tabs)
  web/src/components/ActivationCodeCard.tsx (+P15 guidance copy)
  web/src/app/profile/page.tsx          (+RankMetricCard)
  No migration (all fields pre-existed or are UI-local).

