ERRORS: [] (all browser runs)

SELF-CORRECTION (stated, not hidden): the first M8 harness queried
`button[aria-pressed]`, which also matches the "Marquer pour revoir" toggle —
so it "found options" on a QROC question and reported a false NO-EYE. Caught
by cross-checking the screenshot (Q1 QROC, no options possible), fixed the
selector to `[aria-label="Options de réponse"] button[aria-pressed]`, re-ran:
eye renders, strike/forgive behave as above. The app was correct throughout;
the checker was wrong.

